content_blocks:
[
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "value": "Instance Settings",
    "level": 1
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "Configure your instance settings below. Changes require a restart to take effect."
  },
  {
    "type": "divider"
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "value": "General",
    "level": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "| Setting | Value |\n|---------|-------|\n| **Instance Name** | {{instance.name}} |\n| **Display Name** | {{instance.display_name}} |\n| **Description** | {{instance.description}} |\n| **Icon** | {{instance.icon}} |\n| **Color** | {{instance.color}} |"
  },
  {
    "type": "divider"
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "value": "Resource Limits",
    "level": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "| Limit | Value |\n|-------|-------|\n| **Memory Limit** | {{limits.memory_mib}} MiB |\n| **CPU Limit** | {{limits.cpu_cores}} cores |\n| **Disk Limit** | {{limits.disk_mib}} MiB |\n| **Memory Overcommit** | {{limits.mem_overcommit_pct}}% |\n| **Disk Overcommit** | {{limits.disk_overcommit_pct}}% |"
  },
  {
    "type": "divider"
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "value": "Network",
    "level": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "| Setting | Value |\n|---------|-------|\n| **Primary IP** | {{network.primary_ip}} |\n| **Port Range** | {{network.port_range}} |\n| **Allocated Ports** | {{network.allocated_ports}} |"
  },
  {
    "type": "divider"
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "value": "Advanced",
    "level": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "| Setting | Value |\n|---------|-------|\n| **Install Directory** | {{advanced.install_dir}} |\n| **Instances Directory** | {{advanced.instances_dir}} |\n| **Allowed Kinds** | {{advanced.allowed_kinds}} |\n| **Auto-start** | {{advanced.auto_start}} |"
  },
  {
    "type": "divider"
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "value": "Danger Zone",
    "level": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "⚠️ **These actions are irreversible:**\n\n• **Reinstall** - Wipes instance data and re-deploys from template\n• **Destroy** - Permanently deletes the instance and all data"
  },
  {
    "type": "button",
    "value": "Reinstall Instance",
    "href": "#action:reinstall"
  },
  {
    "type": "button",
    "value": "Destroy Instance",
    "href": "#action:destroy"
  }
]
